Note the first ten fibonacci numbers end note.
To fibonacci with n, do
  If n is at most 2, then
    give back 1.
  end if.
  give back the result of fibonacci with n minus 1 plus the result of fibonacci with n minus 2.
end function.
Count from 1 to 10 using i,
  Say text fibonacci number end text, i, text is end text, the result of fibonacci with i.
end loop.
